            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.40.7+JER.40.8+JER.40.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 40:7-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man pi dhanu m’udong’ i ng’om Yuda, ma Nebukadnezar m’ubimo mi Babeli weko, eketho Gedalia ma wod Ahikam, ma wod Cafan, ni jabim i wigi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie kinde ma jego ceke mir udul asikari, gin ku dhanu migi, giwinjo nia ubimo mi Babeli ketho Gedalia ni jabim, gibino ba Gedalia i Mizpa, en e Icmael ma wod Nethania, man Yohanan ma wod Kareya, man Seraya ma wod Tanhumeth ma Janetofathi, ku Yazania ma wod Jamakathi, gin ku dhanu migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Gedalia kwong’o igi man ni dhanu migi, ewacu igi kumae, Lworo kud unegwu kum jutic mi Jukaldayo: wubed i ng’ombuni, man wutim ni ubimo mi Babeli, e lembe mu bibedo ber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.41.1+JER.41.2+JER.41.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 41:1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento etimbre i dwi mir abirone, nia Icmael ma wod Nethania, ma wod Elicama mi kodhi ker, ubino, giku dhanu apar, man gigoyo Gedalia, ketho nia etho, man Juyahudi ku Jukaldayo ma gini kude i Mizpa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.43.5+JER.43.6+JER.43.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 43:5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man dhanu ceke, ma thindho ku ma dongo de, ku jego mi njuru asikari, giai, man gibino Misiri; kum lworo negogi kum Jukaldayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
